{
  "id": 4,
  "title": "DHCP Server Setup",
  "topic": "DHCP & Application Layer",
  "description": "A Server has been placed as the DHCP server. Configure a DHCP pool on it so that PC1 and PC2 automatically receive IP addresses. Then verify that both PCs can ping each other.",
  "ccnaRef": "CCNA ITN: Module 15 – IP Addressing Services",
  "sandboxMode": false,
  "objectives": [
    { "id": "obj1", "desc": "Server has a DHCP pool for 192.168.1.0/24" },
    { "id": "obj2", "desc": "PC1 receives an IP from DHCP (192.168.1.0/24)" },
    { "id": "obj3", "desc": "PC2 receives an IP from DHCP (192.168.1.0/24)" },
    { "id": "obj4", "desc": "PC1 can ping PC2" }
  ],
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "obj1",
      "type": "dhcp-pool",
      "desc": "DHCP pool on SRV1 covers 192.168.1.0/24",
      "hostname": "SRV1",
      "expectedNetwork": "192.168.1.0",
      "expectedMask": "255.255.255.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "obj2",
      "type": "subnet",
      "desc": "PC1 is in 192.168.1.0/24",
      "hostname": "PC1",
      "interface": "Fa0",
      "expectedNetwork": "192.168.1.0",
      "expectedMask": "255.255.255.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "obj3",
      "type": "subnet",
      "desc": "PC2 is in 192.168.1.0/24",
      "hostname": "PC2",
      "interface": "Fa0",
      "expectedNetwork": "192.168.1.0",
      "expectedMask": "255.255.255.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "obj4",
      "type": "ping",
      "desc": "PC1 → PC2 ping succeeds",
      "srcDeviceId": "pc-4a",
      "dstIp": "192.168.1.20"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Click on SRV1, then go to the Advanced tab to configure the DHCP pool.",
    "Set Network: 192.168.1.0, Start: 192.168.1.10, End: 192.168.1.100, Mask: 255.255.255.0",
    "After applying the DHCP pool, manually assign IPs to PC1 (192.168.1.10) and PC2 (192.168.1.20) to simulate DHCP lease — the game auto-validates the subnet membership.",
    "DHCP is an Application-Layer (L7) protocol that uses UDP port 67 (server) and 68 (client)."
  ],
  "topology": {
    "devices": [
      {
        "id": "srv-4", "type": "server", "hostname": "SRV1", "x": 520, "y": 200,
        "interfaces": [
          { "name": "FastEthernet0", "shortName": "Fa0", "status": "up", "ipAddress": "192.168.1.1", "subnetMask": "255.255.255.0", "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:04:00:01" }
        ],
        "config": { "defaultGateway": "" },
        "dhcpPool": null
      },
      {
        "id": "sw-4a", "type": "switch", "hostname": "SW1", "x": 520, "y": 320,
        "interfaces": [
          { "name": "FastEthernet0/0", "shortName": "Fa0/0", "status": "up", "vlanId": 1 },
          { "name": "FastEthernet0/1", "shortName": "Fa0/1", "status": "up", "vlanId": 1 },
          { "name": "FastEthernet0/2", "shortName": "Fa0/2", "status": "up", "vlanId": 1 }
        ],
        "vlans": [{ "id": 1, "name": "default" }],
        "config": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "pc-4a", "type": "pc", "hostname": "PC1", "x": 300, "y": 420,
        "interfaces": [
          { "name": "FastEthernet0", "shortName": "Fa0", "status": "up", "ipAddress": "", "subnetMask": "", "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:04:00:02" }
        ],
        "config": { "defaultGateway": "192.168.1.1" }
      },
      {
        "id": "pc-4b", "type": "pc", "hostname": "PC2", "x": 740, "y": 420,
        "interfaces": [
          { "name": "FastEthernet0", "shortName": "Fa0", "status": "up", "ipAddress": "", "subnetMask": "", "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:04:00:03" }
        ],
        "config": { "defaultGateway": "192.168.1.1" }
      }
    ],
    "links": [
      { "id": "l4-1", "sourceDeviceId": "srv-4",  "sourceInterface": "FastEthernet0",   "destDeviceId": "sw-4a", "destInterface": "FastEthernet0/0", "type": "ethernet", "status": "up" },
      { "id": "l4-2", "sourceDeviceId": "pc-4a",  "sourceInterface": "FastEthernet0",   "destDeviceId": "sw-4a", "destInterface": "FastEthernet0/1", "type": "ethernet", "status": "up" },
      { "id": "l4-3", "sourceDeviceId": "pc-4b",  "sourceInterface": "FastEthernet0",   "destDeviceId": "sw-4a", "destInterface": "FastEthernet0/2", "type": "ethernet", "status": "up" }
    ]
  }
}
